#: admin/class-ppcart-pro-menu-previews.php:11
msgid ""
"Collections combine multiple products in a single checkout. Add products to "
"a collection and choose whether to use their existing prices or set custom "
"prices for the collection."
msgstr ""
"Sammlungen kombinieren mehrere Produkte in einem einzigen Checkout. Fügen "
